<p>After a look to see if the data is what we want (it is) we can then download the full dataset for the Highland Council area. This gives daily aggregated counts at each site of cyclists, pedestrians, motorcycles, cars, buses, and goods vehicles from March 2021 to June 2026.</p>
<p>In the next post, we’ll look at how the cycle counts compare to the other city centre sites:</p>
<div class="quarto-figure quarto-figure-center">
<figure class="figure">
